This project contains adapted source from:

- GeoEvidence Studio, licensed under Apache-2.0
- WorkLoom-video-edit, licensed under Apache-2.0

The imported source and license files are kept under `engines/geo-evidence`
and `engines/video-edit`. The integrated system uses those engines in-process
and does not require the external repositories at runtime.

Runtime dependencies:

- sharp 0.35.5, licensed under Apache-2.0, is used only for bounded server-side
  raster rendering and rendered-image inspection. It is installed from the npm
  registry and is not vendored into this repository.
